### 2.3 Tolerance-window sizing (depth 8, quantised timestamps)

reorder delay distribution: n=220 p50=300000 ns p90=600000 ns p99=700000 ns max=700000 ns

`grace_ns` is measured on the stream clock, so it also fires on a quiet
session. A grace keyed on *more events arriving* would never fire exactly when
a lost event sits alone in the buffer.

